// A variation block holds only alternatives.

== fixture.variations
@cycle
    mira: No dash.
//  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB2501
    mira: Reported once per block.
@sequence
    - mira: A real alternative.
    @set $x = 1
//  ^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB2501
@cycle
    mira: Hm. // The span stops before a comment.
//  ^^^^^^^^^ PIB2501

// Must not trigger

@cycle
    - mira: Hm.
    - mira: Huh.
@once
    mira: @once holds statements, not alternatives.
